You are building AlgoLens — a premium local DSA visualization platform.

STACK: React 18 + TypeScript + Vite + Tailwind CSS + Framer Motion + 
Zustand + React Flow + D3 + Monaco Editor. Backend: FastAPI + Python.

DESIGN SYSTEM:
- Background: #08080F, Surface: #0F0F1A, Border: #1E1E2E
- Primary: #7C3AED (violet), Accent: #06B6D4 (cyan)
- Success: #10B981, Warning: #F59E0B, Danger: #EF4444
- Text: #E2E8F0, Muted: #64748B
- Fonts: Inter for UI, JetBrains Mono for all code

RULES:
- Every meaningful state change must use framer-motion animation
- Use Tailwind exclusively. Zero inline styles. Zero CSS modules.
- All components fully typed. Never use `any`.
- Zustand for all global state. No prop drilling beyond 2 levels.
- All FastAPI responses are typed Pydantic models.
- Visualizer components live in /components/visualizers/
- Components are small and single-responsibility.
- Use lucide-react for all icons, never emoji as UI elements.
- Code must look production-grade. No placeholders, no TODO comments, 
  no lorem ipsum. If something isn't built yet, return a proper 
  skeleton/loading state instead.
